## Usage Advice

- **Scope:** Reached from a gmeow:JustificationSubject via gmeow:adequateUnder\. Formalises the 'adequacy — meets the standard's threshold' component of design/LOGIC\-FOUNDATION\.md \(Argumentation and epistemic standards\), by prose reference \(Principle 5\)\.

## Logic stereotypes

`logic:Kind` — see the [Logic & Reasoning](../../logic/index.md) index.

## Box role

[TBox (`gmeow:boxTBox`)](../../four-boxes/index.md)

## Constraints

- An AdequacyAssessment must carry exactly one gmeow:AdequacyVerdict \(gmeow:meetsThreshold\)\.
- An AdequacyAssessment must name exactly one gmeow:EpistemicStandard \(gmeow:adequacyUnderStandard\)\.

